    intro: 'Whirlpool (and the Maytag, KitchenAid, and Amana fridges built on the same platforms) use a reliable icemaker, so when it stops there\'s usually a specific, fixable cause. Here\'s the order a tech checks them, plus the simple things you can rule out yourself first.',
