    metaDesc: 'OF OF on a Samsung refrigerator isn\'t a breakdown — it\'s demo/showroom mode, which turns off cooling. Here\'s how to exit it and get cooling back for free.',
    intro: 'Good news first: "OF OF" (or "O FF") on a Samsung refrigerator is NOT a broken fridge — it\'s **demo mode** (also called showroom or cooling-off mode). Stores use it so a fridge lights up on the sales floor without running the compressor. If it got switched on by accident, the display works but the fridge doesn\'t cool. The fix is free and takes about 10 seconds. Here\'s how to get out of it.',
